Greetings,

We announce the new driver nsp32 - Workbit NinjaSCSI-32Bi/UDE
PCI/Cardbus SCSI adapter. This driver supports at least (we tested) 7
different PCI/Cardbus SCSI cards which use Workbit NinjaSCSI-32 SCSI
processor.  This driver is now in linux 2.5.41. I put them at:

        http://gotom.jp/~gotom/patch/nsp32/
        patch.nsp32-1_3              : nsp32 core driver
        patch.nsp32-2_2.4.20-pre10_1 : other part for 2.4.20-pre10
        patch.nsp32-2_2.5.40_3       : other part for 2.5.40

You apply patch.nsp32-1_3, then apply patch.nsp32-2_* (select them
with your kernel version).
Any comments are welcome.

Regards,
-- gotom
